gadG(){return"Welcome to Soccerpark Salzburg!"},
gadj(){return"In order to have a fair comparison, soccergolf has very clear guidelines and rules of the game. Of course, in the end, the person who needed the fewest shots always won.    "},
gadm(){return"Each fairway has its own description: a track board. Here you can clearly see the layout of the fairway and the kick-off point on the green mat. So before you play a fairway, please always look at this lane board carefully."},
gadn(){return"The red arrows next to the obstacles indicate in which direction the ball has to go through the obstacle. If the ball is accidentally shot past the obstacle, it must be played back in order to then be able to go through the obstacle in the right direction."},
gado(){return"The kick-off always happens from the green mat. The ball must be placed on or behind the white line. The goal is always a flag with a certain type of hole."},
gadp(){return"If the ball is in the rough (to the right or left of the fairway) or in a bunker, it must be played from there. However, if the ball is shot down a side lane, it is out of bounds and must be replaced to the last starting position from which it was played and one penalty point must be added."},
gadq(){return"It is important that the players in a group always play together: everyone in the group shoots their ball once and remembers its position. The one whose ball is farthest from the target takes the second shot first. Then everyone else in the group continues in the same order. And so it goes on until the balls are sunk in the hole. When the ball is in the hole, the number of shots required is noted on the scorecard or in the app."},
gadr(){return"If a ball is in the way, it can either be played or secured with a marker. However, if a ball is accidentally kicked, the kicked ball is replaced and the other ball is left where it rolls out."},
gads(){return"The maximum number of shots is calculated from the par specification. This is visible on every track board, on the scorecard and in this app. The maximum number of shots is always twice the par value. For example, on a par 3 fairway, the ball must go in the target hole by the 6th shot at the latest. If this is not the case, a penalty point must be added, i.e., you have to note down 7 shots. There are par 3, par 4, par 5 and par 6 holes on the course."},
gadt(){return"There is a water obstacle on lane 9. For safety reasons, entering the water is strictly prohibited. Balls that land in the water can be retrieved with the landing net. You can find the special regulation on the track board."},
gadk(){return"Our toilets are located at the end of the building and are signposted. We attach great importance to order and cleanliness and we ask you to dispose rubbish in the appropriate containers."},
gTa(){return"Of course, we ask that celebrating groups be considerate of other guests throughout the facility, especially families and children. Please do not use any sound systems on the facility!"},
gTb(){return"For reasons of fair play and to avoid major traffic jams, larger groups will allow smaller groups to overtake. The ideal and maximum group size is 4-5 people!"},
gadl(){return"A special note for children's birthday parties: Parents are responsible for supervising their children!"},
gTc(){return"When a track is finished, please leave it quickly! After completing the 18 holes, please always return the balls in groups to the cash desk! You are of course welcome to buy a 2nd round or a day ticket from us at a reduced price."},
gTd(){return"We are happy to provide you with cool drinks, ice cream and snacks. Please do not bring your own food or drinks to the facility!"},
gTe(){return"As a special service we offer you free WLAN. If you liked it with us, we would be very happy to receive positive feedback!"},
gTf(){return"You can get gift vouchers for every occasion at the checkout. If you have any questions or requests, just come to us - we will be happy to help you!"},
gadJ(){return"Welcome to Soccerpark Wagrain-Kleinarl!"},
gadI(){return"The maximum number of shots is calculated from the par specification. This is visible on every track board, on the scorecard and in this app. The maximum number of shots is always twice the par value. For example, on a par 3 fairway, the ball must go in the target hole by the 6th shot at the latest. If this is not the case, a penalty point must be added, i.e., you have to note down 7 shots. There are par 3, par 4 and par 5 holes on the course."},
gadH(){return"Our toilets are located in the ticket office building and are signposted. We attach great importance to order and cleanliness and we ask you to dispose rubbish in the appropriate containers."},
gadu(){return"Welcome to Soccerpark Goldberg!"},
gacq(){return"At what age can you play football golf?"},
gacw(){return"What do I need to bring to football golf?"},
gacx(){return"How long is the waiting time at the holes?"},
gacy(){return"How long does a round of football golf take?"},
gacz(){return"Do I need previous knowledge of football golf?"},
gacA(){return"Is a reservation possible?"},
gacB(){return"What will we do with our reservation if the weather forecast is bad?"},
gacC(){return"Is it necessary to split a larger group into several small groups?"},
gacD(){return"Can I bring food or drinks to the facility?"},
gacr(){return"Do I have to change clothes or wear special clothes?"},
gacs(){return"How do I get the latest dates and news about the soccer park and football golf?"},
gact(){return"Are dogs allowed?"},
gacu(){return"Are there also gift vouchers?"},
gacv(){return"Are celebrations and events possible?"},
ga4R(){return"Football golf can be played from the age of 6 to old age."},
ga4X(){return"Good mood and sports shoes (attention: no knobs or cleated shoes). You can borrow the balls for a deposit - you are also welcome to bring your own balls!"},
ga4Y(){return"Waiting times are possible. The sporting rule that larger groups let smaller groups overtake applies!"},
ga4Z(){return"An average player needs about 2 hours for 18 holes."},
ga5_(){return"No. You will receive a briefing from us at the start, during which all questions will be answered."},
ga50(){return"Reservations are required for bachelor parties and groups of 10 or more people! This way we can plan better and arrange a suitable date or start time with you."},
ga51(){return"If the weather forecast predicts only light rain, football golf is not a problem. We only ask that you call us if there is a reliable bad weather forecast or severe weather warning."},
ga52(){return"Yes. A group consists of a maximum of 5 people who can start at different holes at the same time (cannon start). A cannon start is the mode where all participants in a game round start at the same time but on different holes - this avoids unnecessary waiting times!"},
ga53(){return"It is not allowed to bring your own food and drinks to the facility. At the kiosk you can get drinks, ice cream and snacks, which you can take with you."},
ga4S(){return"No, you can play with normal athletic clothing. Shoe cleaning possible!"},
ga4T(){return"We recommend that you regularly visit our constantly updated Facebook page."},
ga4U(){return"No, dogs are not allowed on the football golf course. At the kiosk they are only allowed to wait on a leash."},
ga4V(){return"Yes, at the cash desk or on the website."},
ga4W(){return"You have all the options at our facility! It is best to contact us in good time so that we can take your special wishes into account when planning. We are happy to discuss special requests for your event."},
